(6376016, 944728, 82545, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the idea behind this photo. Provocative and racy without being too crass. The only thing that takes me away from the weight of this photo is the tag left on the sleeve of the suit jacket. I can understand if the suit was a prop, not wanting to remove the tag, but hiding that would have scored a point higher with me.</td>', 'I like your composition and the idea behind this photo. Provocative and racy without being too crass. The only thing that takes me away from the weight of this photo is the tag left on the sleeve of the suit jacket. I can understand if the suit was a prop, not wanting to remove the tag, but hiding that would have scored a point higher with me.', '2011-04-06 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
