(6376091, 944765, 30712, '<td valign="top">It might be an old idea but this picture really works for me.  I love the limited colour range.</td>', 'It might be an old idea but this picture really works for me.  I love the limited colour range.', '2011-04-06 03:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376127, 944677, 130880, '<td valign="top">It''s painfully high-key.  The hands, as a result, blur; distractingly, into the sky. I think more, of the head, or none, is needed.  The small bit of hair is either too much, or not enough.  I don''t know if it''s really workable in the framework of the challenge (the back of the head is above the neck, after all is said and done).</td>', 'It''s painfully high-key.  The hands, as a result, blur; distractingly, into the sky. I think more, of the head, or none, is needed.  The small bit of hair is either too much, or not enough.  I don''t know if it''s really workable in the framework of the challenge (the back of the head is above the neck, after all is said and done).', '2011-04-06 04:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376130, 944600, 130880, '<td valign="top">The middle is murky, and the subject is ill-defined. I can''t tell what I am supposed to be looking at, and nothing in the frame really leads me to anything. The flowers are the dominant thing in the frame, but they lack the detail to keep my eye.  <br/> <br/>The folded hands pose questions, but the young person in the foreground sort of pushes everything else out of the way, without telling me anything.</td>', 'The middle is murky, and the subject is ill-defined. I can''t tell what I am supposed to be looking at, and nothing in the frame really leads me to anything. The flowers are the dominant thing in the frame, but they lack the detail to keep my eye.   The folded hands pose questions, but the young person in the foreground sort of pushes everything else out of the way, without telling me anything.', '2011-04-06 04:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376133, 944194, 130880, '<td valign="top">The tension in the arms and waist work really well.  They mirror the fall of the sparks.  The curved lines of the tool, the body and the shower stand in contrast to the straight lines of the object the cutting tool is working on, and the surroundings.</td>', 'The tension in the arms and waist work really well.  They mirror the fall of the sparks.  The curved lines of the tool, the body and the shower stand in contrast to the straight lines of the object the cutting tool is working on, and the surroundings.', '2011-04-06 04:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376134, 944898, 130880, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the mid-point shifted up, just a bit, to get a little more detail in the hands of the active player, but the sense of life in the picture is really affecting.</td>', 'I''d like to see the mid-point shifted up, just a bit, to get a little more detail in the hands of the active player, but the sense of life in the picture is really affecting.', '2011-04-06 05:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376138, 944729, 130880, '<td valign="top">This is a really well executed concept, and the lack of head adds to the power of the shot.  The low-key aspects of the shot, and the wide gamut of tone/zone inside the image are handled well.  The strain of body to make the model in the mirror look, "fat" adds to the effect.</td>', 'This is a really well executed concept, and the lack of head adds to the power of the shot.  The low-key aspects of the shot, and the wide gamut of tone/zone inside the image are handled well.  The strain of body to make the model in the mirror look, "fat" adds to the effect.', '2011-04-06 05:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376140, 944745, 130880, '<td valign="top">The largest improvement would be the lack of the lower hand.  I''d like to see a bit more modelling too, but that''s not as distracting as the hand; which both grabs the eye, and takes work to identify.</td>', 'The largest improvement would be the lack of the lower hand.  I''d like to see a bit more modelling too, but that''s not as distracting as the hand; which both grabs the eye, and takes work to identify.', '2011-04-06 05:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376141, 944559, 130880, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the soft focus helps here.  I''d also like to see some action, as the metal is at striking temperature, and the smith needs to work it before it goes back into the forge, or gets too cold to work.<br/> <br/>If something was happening, I''d find the lack of any point of focus more acceptable.</td>', 'I don''t think the soft focus helps here.  I''d also like to see some action, as the metal is at striking temperature, and the smith needs to work it before it goes back into the forge, or gets too cold to work. If something was happening, I''d find the lack of any point of focus more acceptable.', '2011-04-06 05:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376142, 943779, 130880, '<td valign="top">It''s just too busy.</td>', 'It''s just too busy.', '2011-04-06 05:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376143, 944798, 130880, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title, it would just be surreal.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title, it would just be surreal.', '2011-04-06 05:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376144, 944759, 130880, '<td valign="top">The body language tells the story.  I didn''t need the title to get a senseof what was going on.  The color in the shirt does a good job of bringing the subject out of the background.</td>', 'The body language tells the story.  I didn''t need the title to get a senseof what was going on.  The color in the shirt does a good job of bringing the subject out of the background.', '2011-04-06 05:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376145, 944765, 130880, '<td valign="top">The coins pick the color of the frame up well.</td>', 'The coins pick the color of the frame up well.', '2011-04-06 05:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376146, 944728, 91360, '<td valign="top">excellent work here! her name isn''t Angelina right? :))</td>', 'excellent work here! her name isn''t Angelina right? :))', '2011-04-06 05:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376147, 944786, 130880, '<td valign="top">Nice job on a difficult subject.  There is a lot going on, and you managed to find a nice set of patterns, in the lines of the vegetables and the circles of the plates. The chopsticks in the background mirror the vegetables in the foreground plate, and the steel bowl repeats the plates.</td>', 'Nice job on a difficult subject.  There is a lot going on, and you managed to find a nice set of patterns, in the lines of the vegetables and the circles of the plates. The chopsticks in the background mirror the vegetables in the foreground plate, and the steel bowl repeats the plates.', '2011-04-06 05:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376148, 944894, 91360, '<td valign="top">I think you wanted this into the chips challenge..:))</td>', 'I think you wanted this into the chips challenge..:))', '2011-04-06 05:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376150, 944732, 130880, '<td valign="top">A good study, and the way the color of the skin moves from the whiter/brighter bottom to the darker/warmer top is strong.  I don''t know quite what I think of the border.  I find it distracting, but I don''t know what I would think without it.</td>', 'A good study, and the way the color of the skin moves from the whiter/brighter bottom to the darker/warmer top is strong.  I don''t know quite what I think of the border.  I find it distracting, but I don''t know what I would think without it.', '2011-04-06 05:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376151, 944733, 130880, '<td valign="top">It captures the moment well.</td>', 'It captures the moment well.', '2011-04-06 05:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376152, 944618, 130880, '<td valign="top">I''m of a mixed mind.  I suspect the real problem is that it doesn''t translate well to the screen, and that a print would really jump out at me.  I''m voting with that problem in mind.</td>', 'I''m of a mixed mind.  I suspect the real problem is that it doesn''t translate well to the screen, and that a print would really jump out at me.  I''m voting with that problem in mind.', '2011-04-06 05:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376154, 944696, 130880, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if there was more visible tension, perhaps in her hands.</td>', 'I think it would be better if there was more visible tension, perhaps in her hands.', '2011-04-06 05:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376155, 944635, 130880, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing the sense of wonder.  Less is more.</td>', 'Good job of capturing the sense of wonder.  Less is more.', '2011-04-06 05:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
