(6381090, 944894, 101702, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge. There should be nothing above the neck in your shot, and I can clearly see her face.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge. There should be nothing above the neck in your shot, and I can clearly see her face.', '2011-04-10 08:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381229, 944677, 47470, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the highlights on this are very overblown.  Yet something about this is very appealing to me.  It somehow looks like something from the 1950s.  I''m not sure if it would loose that vintage feel if it were properly exposed, but if it did, I''d take the over-exposure just to keep that old feeling!</td>', 'Unfortunately, the highlights on this are very overblown.  Yet something about this is very appealing to me.  It somehow looks like something from the 1950s.  I''m not sure if it would loose that vintage feel if it were properly exposed, but if it did, I''d take the over-exposure just to keep that old feeling!', '2011-04-10 12:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381232, 944898, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a bit more detail in the shadows.  As it is, the black seems to swallow the rest of the image.</td>', 'I wish there was a bit more detail in the shadows.  As it is, the black seems to swallow the rest of the image.', '2011-04-10 12:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381236, 944337, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used Clarify or some similar technique.  While that gives some great gritty detail that helps convey the horror or a dentist''s chair, I still wish the image was a little brighter overall, particularly in some of the shadows.</td>', 'It looks like you used Clarify or some similar technique.  While that gives some great gritty detail that helps convey the horror or a dentist''s chair, I still wish the image was a little brighter overall, particularly in some of the shadows.', '2011-04-10 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381241, 944842, 47470, '<td valign="top">If you''re at the Vatican, those were designed by someone *very* famous ; )<br/>As for the image, I think the background is very distracting.  I would have cropped off at least the bottom quarter, since it doesn''t tell us anything we don''t already know, then I would have used a much shallower depth of field to blur out the background.  I don''t even think it would be necessary to keep the whole subject in focus here; you could focus on just one aspect of the crazy fashion (the buttons and the belt buckle, for example) and blur the rest so you can make sure the image has a very prominent/specific focus (which would also give the image a more specific message--which specific part of the outfit would the fashion police arrest him for?).</td>', 'If you''re at the Vatican, those were designed by someone *very* famous ; )As for the image, I think the background is very distracting.  I would have cropped off at least the bottom quarter, since it doesn''t tell us anything we don''t already know, then I would have used a much shallower depth of field to blur out the background.  I don''t even think it would be necessary to keep the whole subject in focus here; you could focus on just one aspect of the crazy fashion (the buttons and the belt buckle, for example) and blur the rest so you can make sure the image has a very prominent/specific focus (which would also give the image a more specific message--which specific part of the outfit would the fashion police arrest him for?).', '2011-04-10 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381244, 944902, 47470, '<td valign="top">Since the image''s focus is probably the hands, I would have liked to see sharper, clearer detail on them.  That way the clarity of the hands (and the flute) would contrast the natural texture of the jacket.  The grain does look beautiful on the stone wall in the background though.</td>', 'Since the image''s focus is probably the hands, I would have liked to see sharper, clearer detail on them.  That way the clarity of the hands (and the flute) would contrast the natural texture of the jacket.  The grain does look beautiful on the stone wall in the background though.', '2011-04-10 12:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381246, 944800, 47470, '<td valign="top">Since the body is out of focus, you should have used more directional/contrasty light on her to help define her shape and to help her stand out amongst the rest of the blur.  More "pretty" light on the bottle might also explain why the bottle is in focus instead of the person.</td>', 'Since the body is out of focus, you should have used more directional/contrasty light on her to help define her shape and to help her stand out amongst the rest of the blur.  More "pretty" light on the bottle might also explain why the bottle is in focus instead of the person.', '2011-04-10 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381249, 944765, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  The frame helps explain why the head is cut off, which I think isn''t really addressed in a lot of other images in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  The frame helps explain why the head is cut off, which I think isn''t really addressed in a lot of other images in the challenge.', '2011-04-10 12:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381251, 944866, 47470, '<td valign="top">Man, I really wish the negative space in the upper right was filled by some giant motorcycle handlebars!  Then his arm would have made a nice leading line back to the text too.</td>', 'Man, I really wish the negative space in the upper right was filled by some giant motorcycle handlebars!  Then his arm would have made a nice leading line back to the text too.', '2011-04-10 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381262, 944752, 47470, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image.  The BnW conversion is great, the light is fitting, the DoF is spot-on, the contrast of tones between the sweater and the chair helps hold everything together, and the details (knitting, ring, glasses, necklace, pin, etc) create enough interest in the space so that the viewer isn''t wishing the head wasn''t cut off!  One of the best I''ve seen in the challenge so far.</td>', 'What a beautiful image.  The BnW conversion is great, the light is fitting, the DoF is spot-on, the contrast of tones between the sweater and the chair helps hold everything together, and the details (knitting, ring, glasses, necklace, pin, etc) create enough interest in the space so that the viewer isn''t wishing the head wasn''t cut off!  One of the best I''ve seen in the challenge so far.', '2011-04-10 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381273, 944911, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can kinda understand the choice of the soft focus since love makes everything seem so much softer and such, but I''m not convinced that the low contrast fits.  They look like they (and maybe their love?) are fading away, which I don''t think was your intention.  The girl''s straight-on stance is also too static and unresponsive.  I would have liked to see her responding to the man''s display of affection.  And since this image leans towards minimalism, attention to detail is even more important than ever--her necklace is right in the middle of the image and is the only dark part of the whole image, so the clasp should have been moved to the back of her neck.</td>', 'I can kinda understand the choice of the soft focus since love makes everything seem so much softer and such, but I''m not convinced that the low contrast fits.  They look like they (and maybe their love?) are fading away, which I don''t think was your intention.  The girl''s straight-on stance is also too static and unresponsive.  I would have liked to see her responding to the man''s display of affection.  And since this image leans towards minimalism, attention to detail is even more important than ever--her necklace is right in the middle of the image and is the only dark part of the whole image, so the clasp should have been moved to the back of her neck.', '2011-04-10 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381277, 944122, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the title pulled the whole image together a bit better or that there were some more clues as to the meaning behind the image somewhere.  I don''t see the connection (or a reason for the contract between) the man and the flowers.  I would have also liked to see a shallow depth of field so that the rest of the street scene (which is not crucial to understanding the image) was blurred out.  The image is also underexposed for no apparent reason; the flowers are probably white in real life, but they are middle grey in this image.</td>', 'I wish the title pulled the whole image together a bit better or that there were some more clues as to the meaning behind the image somewhere.  I don''t see the connection (or a reason for the contract between) the man and the flowers.  I would have also liked to see a shallow depth of field so that the rest of the street scene (which is not crucial to understanding the image) was blurred out.  The image is also underexposed for no apparent reason; the flowers are probably white in real life, but they are middle grey in this image.', '2011-04-10 12:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381291, 944627, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to why you decided to cut off the other half of the person instead of giving a bit more space on her other side so she fell on a third line.  Either way, the simple background fits the subject very well and helps tie the whole scene together.</td>', 'I''m curious as to why you decided to cut off the other half of the person instead of giving a bit more space on her other side so she fell on a third line.  Either way, the simple background fits the subject very well and helps tie the whole scene together.', '2011-04-10 12:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381293, 944159, 47470, '<td valign="top">When hands aren''t spread out flat, it''s hard to tell how old the hands are.  The only real clues here are the title and the fish (which, I admit, I would have missed if I hadn''t read the title).  Having a brightly colored background, maybe made from the child''s shirt, would have helped convey the age of the subject.</td>', 'When hands aren''t spread out flat, it''s hard to tell how old the hands are.  The only real clues here are the title and the fish (which, I admit, I would have missed if I hadn''t read the title).  Having a brightly colored background, maybe made from the child''s shirt, would have helped convey the age of the subject.', '2011-04-10 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381300, 944804, 47470, '<td valign="top">The color and the processing fit the subject very well, though I wonder if the processing hast been pushed just a little too far because of the graininess/sharpening that borders on artifacting at this size.  There is enough detail from the props between the shoulders and the knees that the viewer isn''t wishing to see the face as a way of learning about the subject, which is exactly what you were supposed to do for this challenge.</td>', 'The color and the processing fit the subject very well, though I wonder if the processing hast been pushed just a little too far because of the graininess/sharpening that borders on artifacting at this size.  There is enough detail from the props between the shoulders and the knees that the viewer isn''t wishing to see the face as a way of learning about the subject, which is exactly what you were supposed to do for this challenge.', '2011-04-10 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381304, 944728, 47470, '<td valign="top">The little details from the hands give the viewer all the information they need, so they don''t need to see the faces to understand the scene.  That''s exactly what you were supposed to do for this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'The little details from the hands give the viewer all the information they need, so they don''t need to see the faces to understand the scene.  That''s exactly what you were supposed to do for this challenge.  Well done.', '2011-04-10 12:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381354, 944786, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the circles and ovals of the plates and the bowl.  However only a small section of the rim of the bowl is in focus, the rest is really soft which brings it down.</td>', 'I like the concept and the circles and ovals of the plates and the bowl.  However only a small section of the rim of the bowl is in focus, the rest is really soft which brings it down.', '2011-04-10 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381361, 944089, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like how natural this pose is/looks. I also like the position and the cropping of the hands. I think that really adds something to the composition.</td>', 'I like how natural this pose is/looks. I also like the position and the cropping of the hands. I think that really adds something to the composition.', '2011-04-10 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
