(6383360, 944752, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very nice work here, nice light and a great play of textures. The processing I don''t love so much, I think the duotone dulls the image, and that a nice tritone or quatotaone might have given have given you the vintage look that work for this image, but not have cost you so much dynamic range.<br/>Anyway, a small quibble in a shot I expect to see on the front page.</td>', 'Very nice work here, nice light and a great play of textures. The processing I don''t love so much, I think the duotone dulls the image, and that a nice tritone or quatotaone might have given have given you the vintage look that work for this image, but not have cost you so much dynamic range.Anyway, a small quibble in a shot I expect to see on the front page.', '2011-04-11 21:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383362, 944911, 16106, '<td valign="top">A truly great idea, but the pallet is so limited, and the focus so soft that Im afraid it will turn off a lot of voters. Still it is very sweet and the soft focus is in keeping with the subject and its in my personal top ten.</td>', 'A truly great idea, but the pallet is so limited, and the focus so soft that Im afraid it will turn off a lot of voters. Still it is very sweet and the soft focus is in keeping with the subject and its in my personal top ten.', '2011-04-11 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383364, 944729, 16106, '<td valign="top">I look forward to finding out how this was done, I think I see a difference in freckle count between your models, and I hope its enough to keep people from thinking you did an illegal edit and voting you down. this shot works on many levels, It tells a story truly and quickly. It has a very nice tonal range, showing skill in lighting and editing. And it is a fine graphic. I hope to see it win a ribbon.</td>', 'I look forward to finding out how this was done, I think I see a difference in freckle count between your models, and I hope its enough to keep people from thinking you did an illegal edit and voting you down. this shot works on many levels, It tells a story truly and quickly. It has a very nice tonal range, showing skill in lighting and editing. And it is a fine graphic. I hope to see it win a ribbon.', '2011-04-11 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383367, 944721, 16106, '<td valign="top">Cute, clever and wow is this well lit! You really got those Vargas skin tones to play up the pin-up girl imagery. Top five.</td>', 'Cute, clever and wow is this well lit! You really got those Vargas skin tones to play up the pin-up girl imagery. Top five.', '2011-04-11 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383370, 944759, 16106, '<td valign="top">There are a few images that really tell a story in this challenge and this is one of the best. You really captured the deflated body posture of disappointment.<br/> <br/>On the downside, the bohken in the background is lovely but it is busy enough to pull my eye away from the story, and has nothing to say. And the hand holding the phone is a major element of the image and I wish it were in focus. <br/> <br/>That said, nice work, top ten.</td>', 'There are a few images that really tell a story in this challenge and this is one of the best. You really captured the deflated body posture of disappointment. On the downside, the bohken in the background is lovely but it is busy enough to pull my eye away from the story, and has nothing to say. And the hand holding the phone is a major element of the image and I wish it were in focus.  That said, nice work, top ten.', '2011-04-11 21:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383373, 944243, 16106, '<td valign="top">A beautiful moment captured, but to my eye you sacrificed the whites and the skin tones for the sake of the minister''s dark suit. The suit looks great but isn''t the story, the skin tones the shirt and the dress aren''t really burnt out but they area all in a very narrow tonal range, one where the real story is taking place.</td>', 'A beautiful moment captured, but to my eye you sacrificed the whites and the skin tones for the sake of the minister''s dark suit. The suit looks great but isn''t the story, the skin tones the shirt and the dress aren''t really burnt out but they area all in a very narrow tonal range, one where the real story is taking place.', '2011-04-11 21:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
