(6384923, 944728, 66641, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful shot, but the "assignment" was to shoot subjects <b>between the knee and the neck</b>, which was very challenging and the criteria that everyone tried to fulfill.  The woman in the background doesn''t fulfill that.  I''m not sure why everyone is ok with it.  Maybe it''s because the second part says "without feet and face," but to me it was clear that the challenge was supposed to be difficult because we could only shoot between knee and neck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 11:19:25.</i></td>', 'It''s a wonderful shot, but the "assignment" was to shoot subjects between the knee and the neck, which was very challenging and the criteria that everyone tried to fulfill.  The woman in the background doesn''t fulfill that.  I''m not sure why everyone is ok with it.  Maybe it''s because the second part says "without feet and face," but to me it was clear that the challenge was supposed to be difficult because we could only shoot between knee and neck.', '2011-04-13 12:17:40.000000', '2011-04-13 12:19:25.000000', 0),
