(6385003, 944903, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> 1 or 10, 1 or 10.  dpc wont abide abstracts, therefore 1; yet abstracts are real art unlike the crap commercial images here, therefore a 10.  yet this has no relationship to the challenge, thus it should be a 1 but Im giving it a 5.  got that? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I believe you failed to see the amputated torsos.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: 1 or 10, 1 or 10.  dpc wont abide abstracts, therefore 1; yet abstracts are real art unlike the crap commercial images here, therefore a 10.  yet this has no relationship to the challenge, thus it should be a 1 but Im giving it a 5.  got that?   I believe you failed to see the amputated torsos.', '2011-04-13 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
