(6385246, 943901, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sjhuls:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought this might be yours. Looks like we had the same idea, when I saw yours I thought oh no! this one is better than mine. Congrats on your HM very well deserved. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is really odd because I was going to do a ballerina shot as well but for some reason I had a feeling that Jennifer (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69668" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">njsabs</a>) would probably do it too so I decided to do something else.  Can''t believe that I was actually right, hah! Congrats on HM!  It is a beautiful shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 14:50:04.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by sjhuls: I thought this might be yours. Looks like we had the same idea, when I saw yours I thought oh no! this one is better than mine. Congrats on your HM very well deserved.   This is really odd because I was going to do a ballerina shot as well but for some reason I had a feeling that Jennifer ( njsabs) would probably do it too so I decided to do something else.  Can''t believe that I was actually right, hah! Congrats on HM!  It is a beautiful shot!', '2011-04-13 15:41:33.000000', '2011-04-13 15:50:04.000000', 0),
(6385254, 944830, 112972, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you should buy Photoshop at all.  You are doing fine with the tools that you already have :)  j/k of course.  It is impressive that without having Photoshop you are doing so well in the challenges.  You are on a roll!  Congrats in HM!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 16:00:26.</i></td>', 'I don''t think you should buy Photoshop at all.  You are doing fine with the tools that you already have :)  j/k of course.  It is impressive that without having Photoshop you are doing so well in the challenges.  You are on a roll!  Congrats in HM!', '2011-04-13 15:44:01.000000', '2011-04-13 17:00:26.000000', 0),
(6385268, 944738, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> border so unnecessary. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was this comment really necessary? :)  I have noticed that you show a certain reaction to pictures with borders and not so <i>attractive</i> titles.  If borders are what ruin a picture for you, then you probably consider many pictures on DPC ruined since so many people use them.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 15:16:03.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: border so unnecessary.   Was this comment really necessary? :)  I have noticed that you show a certain reaction to pictures with borders and not so attractive titles.  If borders are what ruin a picture for you, then you probably consider many pictures on DPC ruined since so many people use them.', '2011-04-13 15:48:22.000000', '2011-04-13 16:16:03.000000', 0),
(6385539, 944627, 126903, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for your comments.  I always enjoy hearing others thoughts and ideas.  Stefanie I cropped right in like this as it just felt right to me, I started with the whole person but this is where I ended up. Also there was someone standing next to her so after they were croppped out she was pretty much butted up to the side of the frame anyway.</td>', 'Thanks to all for your comments.  I always enjoy hearing others thoughts and ideas.  Stefanie I cropped right in like this as it just felt right to me, I started with the whole person but this is where I ended up. Also there was someone standing next to her so after they were croppped out she was pretty much butted up to the side of the frame anyway.', '2011-04-13 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6385543, 944721, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yes, this was a striking idea, FocusPoint.  <br/> <br/>Two things.  If you had eliminated the swimsuit detail (obviously raising the board to cover the necessities) and if you had eliminated the tiny board shadow,  yes, this could and should have been on the front page.  (Well, okay, make the board very black) It''s a cute and original idea.  Just, maybe a tiny bit soft on the execution.<br/> <br/>Great model, fine pose, and as others have said, those skin tones are excellent.</td>', 'Yes, this was a striking idea, FocusPoint.   Two things.  If you had eliminated the swimsuit detail (obviously raising the board to cover the necessities) and if you had eliminated the tiny board shadow,  yes, this could and should have been on the front page.  (Well, okay, make the board very black) It''s a cute and original idea.  Just, maybe a tiny bit soft on the execution. Great model, fine pose, and as others have said, those skin tones are excellent.', '2011-04-13 20:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
